       "The Sardar Sarovar dam on the Narmada river (Gujarat) is the key dam of the Narmada Valley project.",
       "The Tehri dam is on the Bhagirathi (Uttarakhand), Nagarjuna Sagar on the Krishna, and Tungabhadra and Rana Pratap Sagar are other major dams.",
