       "Trained 'Aapda Mitras' assist the administration in rescue work.",
       "Water conservation reduces drought risk.",
       "Traditional knowledge: unusual animal behaviour is considered a sign of earthquakes.",
       "The community manages community kitchens and relief camps.",
       "Exam fact: the local community responds first in a disaster."
